        "## Task 4 — Vowel counter across words (≈15 min)\n",
        "\n",
        "Use a **sentinel** loop to read words until the user types `done`.  \n",
        "For each word, use a **nested loop** (loop over characters) to count **vowels** `a e i o u` (case-insensitive).\n",
